              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The materials and datasets accompanying the paper: \"Synchronizing User-Chatbot Communication Style and Avatar Appearance for Enhanced Learning in Educational Chatbots\" This study explored the impact of user-chatbot similarity, both in communication style and avatar appearance, on university students’ learning outcomes, and whether trust in the chatbot mediated this effect. All experimental materials and datasets utilized in this study are available on this page."
